{
 "schema": "combat.grapple.hybrid/1",
 "_about": "PARKED: the grapple on A as Orb picked it, a hybrid of the catch and the clinch with the clinch first (docs/combat/grapple-hybrid.md). The paired phases as data: each phase's ticks (first values; Game Design rules them), the holder's anchor on the held body (Legal g05: collar and elbow, or the waist), and the poses each side needs. This is the input a `pair` kind of part in Combat's generator would read (Animation's ask, docs/animation/brawl-second-pass-view.md section 3); it is not built. Nothing here is loaded or hashed",
 "_rules": "docs/design/grapple.md (Game Design, 56d4b581, and its re-rulings of 2026-10-17): the catch, clinch, carry, throw and limits blocks are its first values. The phases' tick lengths for the tie (4), the pummel (6), the throw (8) and the part (6) are Combat's piece lengths, not ruled",
